
form kink
  link code, like text
  link note, like text
  link hint, like text

task make-kink
  take code, like text
  take note, like text
  take hint, like text
  send back, make kink
    bind code, read code
    bind note, read note
    bind hint, read hint

task kink-code
  take k, like kink
  fork case, read k
    hook kink, base code, base note, base hint
      send back, read code

task kink-note
  take k, like kink
  fork case, read k
    hook kink, base code, base note, base hint
      send back, read note
